  "title": "Novonesis Invests in Maharashtra Enzyme Plants",
  "summary": "Novonesis plans to invest ₹6,660 crore in Maharashtra's biosolutions facility to expand its enzyme production, with the facility expected to be fully operational by 2030. The expansion will cover a range of industries including biofuels, household care, and food and beverages, aiming to meet growing demand in emerging markets like the Middle East, Africa, India, and South Asia.",
  "facts": [
